Subject: [PATCH] xolehlp: in-process transaction coordinator with two phase
 commit

- ITransaction::Commit/Abort drive the enlisted ITransactionResourceAsync objects: prepare, commit or abort,
  with answers through ITransactionEnlistmentAsync (read-only and single phase votes, failed votes, timeout)
- IResourceManager::Enlist, Reenlist (nothing is logged, so no transaction is in doubt),
  GetDistributedTransactionManager; resource managers keep their transaction manager
- transactions get a unit-of-work id; remote computers report XACT_E_TMNOTAVAILABLE

